{"id":"0ca50bc0037ccc27","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Order Sum Carrier","display":"df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier — ZFC Order12 Order Sum Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier — ZFC Order12 Order Sum Carrier","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier — ZFC Order12 Order Sum Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,I,P \\in V\">\\(S,I,P \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> is a set function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderSumCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderSumCarrier}_S\\)</span> is the three-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}order\\text{-}sum\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderSumCarrier}_S(S,I,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(P,I,\\operatorname{ran}(P))\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in P(i)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}order\\text{-}sum\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderSumCarrier}_S(S,I,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(P,I,\\operatorname{ran}(P))\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in P(i)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有序对标签保证不同指标的分量即使含有相同元素，也在和载体中保持不交。</li>\n<li>本原子只定义载体；和序关系还需由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上的序及各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(i)\">\\(P(i)\\)</span> 上的序另行给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ is a set function with domain $I$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,I,P \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderSumCarrier}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}order\\text{-}sum\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder12OrderSumCarrier}_S(S,I,P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(P,I,\\operatorname{ran}(P))\\land S=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i\\in I\\land x\\in P(i)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"P(i)","display":false}],"bytes":1050,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2921","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier.md|58-df-zfc-order12-order-sum-carrier]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}